meta {
  name: prompts
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/prompts
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Exactly what the models are told, with the version stamped on every result.

  Read-only by design: these carry the rules that make a finding checkable — that a verdict must
  cite evidence that exists, that PARTIAL must name which clause falls short. Confirm the comparison
  prompt reads COMPARE-V2. V3 briefly let the model report that our own extraction was incomplete
  and was withdrawn: evaluated requirements fell from 187 to 46.
}
